  completed:
    - release_fikr_studio_v0_1_25:
        summary: "Built, Developer-ID signed, Apple notarized, draft-redownload verified, and published Fikr Studio 0.1.25 with six OTA assets; public GitHub and Fikr Studio note readback passed."
    - add_intent_driven_tool_catalog_search_stage:
        summary: "Added deterministic intent-driven search across Fikr tools, skills, sources, memories, and configured MCP descriptors; only selected tools are exposed and only selected MCP servers connect. Internal selection telemetry stays out of live UI. 232 tests, lint, typecheck, build, and Electron greeting proof passed."
    - fix_url_intent_routing_and_lazy_mcp_activation:
        summary: "URL hostnames no longer influence intent; external MCP servers connect only for explicit current-request intent; exact Substack note and greeting regressions plus live Electron proof passed."
    - audit_and_production_verify_document_extraction_go:
        summary: "Production-verified local text PDF extraction, selective OCR, exact page citations, ephemeral image vision, persistence, signed packaging, and real Electron flows; fixed OpenAI-compatible vision tool schemas and preserved the 43-note 12-chat 7-creation workspace."
    - add_fail_closed_one_time_chat_and_creation_cloud_r:
        summary: "Fixed the first-render creations overwrite, restored and independently verified 43 notes/12 chats/7 creations across two Electron launches, exposed persisted drafts safely, added regression coverage, and passed 227 tests plus signed package gates."
    - build_local_pdf_extraction_and_selective_ocr_agent:
        summary: "Added provider-independent local PDF extraction, selective bundled OCR, exact page citations, provenance persistence, packaged runtime verification, and live Electron acceptance for text and scanned PDFs."
    - build_secure_webpage_to_markdown_agent_tool:
        summary: "Added secure built-in fetch_web_page tool with Readability LinkeDOM GFM conversion web citations skills integration packaging hardening and live Electron/OpenRouter validation"
    - repair_chat_retrieval_citations_and_tool_orchestra:
        summary: "Hardened Agents SDK orchestration, citations, attachment handling, MCP approvals, chat rename/delete, and creation persistence; verified 185 tests, all 9 local MCP tools, live image/PDF synthesis, external MCP approval, restart persistence, static Electron build, lint, typecheck, secrets, audit, and build."
    - remove_modal_borders_globally:
        summary: "Removed the border from the shared shadcn DialogContent primitive, preserved internal dividers, added regression coverage, rebuilt, and verified in Electron."
    - fix_modal_select_dropdown_layering:
        summary: "Raised shared shadcn Select portals above dialog layers, added regression coverage, and live-verified Destination and Cover format changes in Electron."
    - soften_shared_shadcn_card_borders:
        summary: "Changed the shared shadcn Card to use a 50% semantic border, added regression coverage, rebuilt, and verified the signed-in dark Electron account page."
    - add_light_dark_and_system_appearance_preference:
        summary: "Added a visible shadcn Light Dark System appearance submenu with persisted system preference, OS resolution, portal layering, and regression coverage."
    - build_gemini_style_plus_menu_for_chat_image_and_pd:
        summary: "Implemented and verified Gemini-style plus menu for image and PDF attachments in both chat composers, with removable image/PDF previews, refined menu placement, 161/161 tests, lint, typecheck, production build, and UI interaction checks passing."
    - complete_production_readiness_audit_verify_studio_:
        summary: "Completed production-readiness verification and the approved race recovery: authenticated cloud/local/UI readback shows 8 spaces, 43 notes, 12 chats, 7 non-empty creations, zero QA markers, and one completion log; the race-fixed 0.1.23 release remains verified and unpublished."
    - implement_production_ui_audit_fixes:
        summary: "Implemented the production UI audit across shared Markdown, Chat outcomes, responsive navigation, Knowledge continuity, Creations, Settings, accessibility, and consumer-product polish; lint, types, 146 tests, and production webpack build pass."
    - redesign_outbound_mcp_connection_flow:
        summary: "Replaced the URL-first Chat tools form with shadcn config import, hosted fallback, discovered-tool permission review, and validated local stdio MCP support."
    - redesign_knowledge_workspace_and_notes_typography:
        summary: "Rebuilt Workspaces and Notes typography, metadata, controls, density, and selected states; verified live interactions and 84 tests."
    - add_smart_space_selection_and_inline_space_creatio:
        summary: "Added deterministic Space recommendations, inline Shadcn Space creation, and explicit save confirmation with tests."
    - restore_clear_shadcn_styling_for_connections_tabs:
        summary: "Restored the standard compact Shadcn segmented tab styling and verified both tab panels switch correctly."
    - replace_connections_plan_status_with_upgrade_actio:
        summary: "Replaced the Local Free header status with a Shadcn Upgrade action linked to Fikr pricing for free accounts."
    - replace_connections_navigation_icon:
        summary: "Replaced the people-shaped Connections rail icon with a semantically correct cable icon at the shared navigation size and stroke weight."
    - make_api_key_banner_global_and_permanent:
        summary: "Moved the no-key notice into a shared permanent Shadcn banner above every main surface and Settings; removed all dismiss state and controls, and verified responsive behavior."
    - simplify_select_action_to_text_only:
        summary: "Removed the list-selection icon and kept the Knowledge header action as text-only Select."
    - repair_knowledge_filter_and_sort_controls:
        summary: "Repaired clipped Knowledge filter and sort selects as compact Shadcn icon controls with explicit accessible current-value labels; verified filter and sort behavior in the live app."
    - tighten_knowledge_note_list_rows:
        summary: "Reduced note-row vertical padding and title-to-metadata spacing for a denser Knowledge list while preserving two-line readability and touch size."
    - unify_desktop_sidebar_widths:
        summary: "Unified Chats, Workspaces, Settings, Creations, and legacy desktop sidebar widths behind one 296px design token while preserving full-width mobile layouts."
    - open_chat_citations_in_a_right_side_note_preview:
        summary: "Chat citations now open a read-only Shadcn right-side note preview with responsive Markdown and optional AI Summary tabs; navigation context is preserved."
    - restore_polished_creation_sharing_and_cover_image_:
        summary: "Restored Creation sharing through a polished Shadcn dialog with destination selection, three cover ratios and styles, local PNG generation, post copying, and explicit platform opening; verified desktop and mobile."
    - keep_contextual_sidebar_width_consistent_across_de:
        summary: "Removed the Chat-only 244px override so Recent Chats and Workspaces both stay at a fixed 296px on desktop; compact layouts remain drawers."
    - render_chat_citations_as_a_compact_vertical_list:
        summary: "Changed chat citations from inline chips to a compact vertical Shadcn list with 10px label text and 11px clickable source rows."
    - remove_inline_artifact_editing_from_chat_results:
        summary: "Removed inline social-artifact editing from chat; retained Shadcn Copy and Save to Creations actions and verified the live action row."
    - set_inter_source_serif_4_and_jetbrains_mono_font_r:
        summary: "Mapped Inter to sans UI, Source Serif 4 to editorial display, and JetBrains Mono to code; verified self-hosted build assets"
    - reset_typography_to_shadcn_default_font_sizes:
        summary: "Replaced arbitrary app font sizes with Tailwind shadcn scale tokens and removed custom prose sizing overrides"
    - polish_local_mcp_connection_card:
        summary: "Reduced local MCP setup to one masked prompt surface, one Shadcn Copy action, and a quiet helper line; verified desktop, 390px responsive layout, lint, types, and 77 tests."
    - align_knowledge_write_mode_markdown_typography:
        summary: "Aligned Knowledge Write mode with the shared 15px/25.8px Markdown scale, matching heading, list, quote, code, and table rhythm while preserving raw Source mode."
    - unify_knowledge_and_chat_markdown_typography:
        summary: "Unified Knowledge Original and AI Summary Markdown with Chat answers on the same responsive 15px reading scale, line-height, headings, spacing, lists, links, tables, quotes, and code while preserving the larger authoring editor."
    - show_full_local_mcp_connection_prompt:
        summary: "Displayed the complete local MCP setup prompt with both URLs and masked tokens, clarified browser-versus-Electron readiness, and verified Electron Copy prompt writes the full real-token prompt without placeholders."
    - standardize_page_headers_across_studio:
        summary: "Standardized Chat, Knowledge, Creations list/detail, Connections, and Settings on one 56px header and divider system; removed legacy title-bar spacers, preserved responsive actions, and verified desktop plus phone layouts."
    - align_contextual_and_main_panel_headers:
        summary: "Aligned the Chat contextual header to the 56px conversation header and the Knowledge contextual header to the 48px workspace toolbar while preserving compact sidebar widths and row density."
    - refine_chat_markdown_rendering:
        summary: "Added a scoped, responsive chat Markdown reading system with Fikr typography, semantic headings and lists, arrow callouts, code, tables, links, and quieter Shadcn citation controls; verified desktop and phone layouts."
    - refine_product_wide_typography_spacing_and_layout_:
        summary: "Unified Chat, Knowledge, Creations, Connections, and Settings around one sans-serif hierarchy, shared spacing scale, flat rows and separators, compact page framing, and responsive light/dark behavior; rendered creation Markdown cleanly."
    - add_native_electron_window_title:
        summary: "Enabled the native Electron title bar, pinned the main window title to Fikr Studio, aligned renderer metadata, removed obsolete hidden-inset spacers, and verified the relaunched window title through macOS accessibility readback."
    - refine_contextual_navigation_visual_hierarchy:
        summary: "Flattened Recent chats into a compact one-line list and moved chat knowledge scope into the composer for consistent new and existing chat controls."
    - repair_dark_mode_across_new_studio_surfaces:
        summary: "Repaired dark and light theme parity for contextual navigation, Chat home, Connections, and mobile navigation using semantic tokens and dark variants; verified every primary surface in the running UI."
    - replace_native_browser_controls_with_shadcn_contro:
        summary: "Replaced every native select in Studio with a shared shadcn Radix Select and verified chat plus Knowledge interactions in the running UI."
    - support_pdf_and_image_chat_attachments:
        summary: "Added bounded PDF and image uploads to Fikr Chat, routed attachment runs through the provider vision model, and verified real OpenRouter image plus PDF understanding in Electron."
    - separate_chat_recents_from_knowledge_workspaces:
        summary: "Separated contextual navigation ownership: Chat now exclusively shows Recent chats, Knowledge exclusively shows Workspaces, desktop columns remain permanent, and compact layouts use dedicated responsive drawers; verified with Shadcn primitives, browser QA, lint, typecheck, 73 tests, and diff check."
    - make_the_application_responsive_and_mobile_ready:
        summary: "Removed the compact-screen blocker and added responsive Shadcn navigation, drawers, list-detail flows, and mobile layouts across Chat, Knowledge, Creations, Connections, and Settings; verified phone, tablet, and desktop."
    - rename_synthesized_tab_to_ai_summary:
        summary: "Renamed the note detail tab from Synthesized to AI Summary; lint and type-check pass."
    - hide_the_macos_dock_icon_while_fikr_studio_runs_in:
        summary: "Closing the macOS window now keeps background services alive while hiding the Dock tile; tray, activation, second launch, and auth callbacks restore the Dock and window."
    - restore_note_multi_select_bulk_move_delete_and_dra:
        summary: "Restored visible note selection mode with Select all and keyboard support, retained bulk delete/recategorize/resynthesize/move actions, added draggable note rows and workspace drop targets, and kept moved notes synchronized with the search index."
    - give_workspace_toolbar_more_breathing_room_and_mak:
        summary: "Expanded the main workspace toolbar to 48px, increased spacing and control heights, and made title/open toolbar regions draggable while preserving no-drag behavior on search and actions."
    - refine_splash_and_onboarding_visual_system:
        summary: "Rebranded the splash and onboarding with the restrained monochrome Fikr visual system, verified light and dark flows and provider dropdowns, added replay from the More menu, and enforced a usable 900x600 desktop minimum."
    - release_v0_1_23_and_harden_delivery:
        summary: "Published verified v0.1.23, installed official Developer ID build, and established one fail-closed local/CI release pipeline with draft redownload verification."
    - expire_completed_asynchronous_mcp_queue_messages:
        summary: "Updated connection guidance, masked relay keys, added explicit key rotation, and removed secret-bearing agent prompts."
    - fix_update_quit_and_install_lifecycle:
        summary: "Restored the storage-safe updater install helper, flushes renderer storage and cookies before quitAndInstall, recovers quit state on asynchronous install failures, and surfaces signature mismatch guidance. Verified the installed ad-hoc 0.1.20 app is running at the update prompt; validation, 56 tests, and production build passed."
    - fix_local_qa_packaged_app_launch:
        summary: "Diagnosed macOS dyld Team-ID mismatch in the ad-hoc fallback package, applied temporary local-only library-validation entitlements to the app and Electron helpers, rebuilt DMG/ZIP, and verified a rendered startup smoke test. Production notarized entitlements were unchanged."
    - harden_studio_mcp_and_relay_runtime_reliability:
        summary: "Added token-refresh propagation, faster relay polling, lease acknowledgements, synthesized-note deduplication, and validated 54 tests plus build."
    - build_current_production_desktop_artifact:
        summary: "Built isolated Fikr Studio 0.1.20 ARM64 production QA artifacts with an ad-hoc local signature; renderer build, 53 tests, lint, typecheck, secret scan, package metadata, app.asar, deep signature, and DMG integrity passed. Release remains blocked by Git-history secret finding, missing Developer ID signing access, and dependency advisories."
    - add_editor_save_shortcut_and_app_wide_sonner_statu:
        summary: "Added Cmd/Ctrl+S editor saving with Cmd/Ctrl+Enter compatibility, a monochrome Shadcn Sonner toaster, status feedback for saves, workspace/article creation, import/export, copy, settings, generation and undo, plus deduplicated persistence failure reporting. Verified live and with lint, typecheck, 53 tests, diff-check, and production build."
    - build_app_wide_keyboard_shortcut_system_and_guide:
        summary: "Added app-wide shortcuts, editable-target safety, global navigation/search/new-entry actions, and a polished discoverable shortcut guide; verified in browser and through lint, typecheck, 53 tests, and production build."
    - refine_connection_row_hover_and_focus_states:
        summary: "Added restrained monochrome hover, coordinated actions, and keyboard focus states to connection rows"
    - move_original_synthesized_switch_into_note_toolbar:
        summary: "Moved note version switching into the detail toolbar and removed the misaligned secondary tab row"
    - implement_creative_director_product_wide_visual_sy:
        summary: "Unified product-wide visual system, simplified Settings and Connections, refined Studio and publish flow, and raised secondary-surface accessibility"
    - replace_the_persistent_entry_composer_with_an_edit:
        summary: "Removed the persistent Entry bar and replaced it with a theme-aware bottom-right plus FAB that opens the full Markdown editor, preserves local drafts, shows draft presence, and retains the global keyboard shortcut."
    - simplify_the_notes_header_and_note_editing_control:
        summary: "Collapsed Notes and count into one compact row, reduced search and filter heights, removed redundant tab icons and inline edit controls, added one toolbar Edit action, and wired double-click on original note content to the same full editor."
    - float_the_entry_composer_above_the_intel_workspace:
        summary: "Moved Entry out of flex flow into a centered bottom overlay, limited pointer events to the composer, retained full-height columns underneath, and raised undo feedback above it."
    - fix_synthesis_null_ai_configuration_crash:
        summary: "Prevented local development synthesis from dereferencing absent BYOK task model settings; local, managed, and BYOK model routing now resolves only its active configuration path."
    - prevent_invalid_bold_and_code_mark_combinations_in:
        summary: "Normalized incompatible emphasis around inline code before rich rendering, preserved fenced code, and prevented toolbar actions from creating invalid mark combinations; added regression coverage."
    - quiet_the_inbox_visual_hierarchy_and_remove_excess:
        summary: "Removed repetitive row and control borders, softened selected surfaces, quieted the new-space action, simplified tab underlines and metadata footer, and preserved semantic tag colors."
    - increase_light_mode_contrast_with_a_restrained_mon:
        summary: "High contrast monochrome interface with original semantic note tag colors preserved"
    - align_typography_with_saveaday_ai_and_enlarge_note:
        summary: "Adopted SaveADay AI typography roles with bundled DM Sans and Newsreader, enlarged the note inbox, and normalized visible workspace typography."
    - hide_grid_view_from_content_toolbar:
        summary: "Removed the grid/masonry toggle from the content toolbar; list and graph remain."
    - build_three_column_inbox_and_editor_content_layout:
        summary: "Built the persistent three-column content workspace with compact searchable and sortable note inbox plus the existing full-featured editor pane."
    - add_ai_markdown_formatter_to_entry_editor:
        summary: "Removed redundant Preview and the AI overlay; added icon-only wording-preserving Format and Clean up actions to the toolbar with inline progress/errors, cancellation, undo, browser QA, validation, tests, and production build."
    - redesign_markdown_editor_as_a_modern_document_fir:
        summary: "Replaced the IDE-like split editor with a Tiptap Markdown-native document canvas, retained exact Source and rendered Preview modes, added calm responsive controls and list-safe tables, and verified rich/source/preview roundtrips, browser behavior, tests, validation, and production build."
    - build_full_markdown_entry_editor_and_existing_note:
        summary: "Implemented source-first Markdown capture and editing with automatic paste expansion, full editor and preview modes, draft recovery, existing-note editing, focused tests, production build, and browser QA."
    - fix_electron_renderer_csp_delivery_and_next_develo:
        summary: "Moved renderer CSP to Electron response headers and enabled only dev React Refresh requirements."
    - release_version_0_1_11:
        summary: "Built, signed, notarized, and published Fikr Studio v0.1.11 to GitHub OTA"
    - browse_all_pages_of_fikr_studio_find_usability_iss:
